{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓團Big Bang前成員T.O.P上月初認愛女星NaNa後，流失不少粉絲，營運了20年的粉絲網站「崔勝鉉.com」亦於上月9日宣布關閉。</p><p>該營運團隊發表了批評性評論，指出事務所缺乏溝通，對粉絲的付出視而不見。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.429341+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T05:41:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_hash":"652d40f04ffb615586369ac1931cb6da8e5c6e50513697d8f4ce933c7a403fa3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}